msgctxt "166\t217"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "218\t287"
msgid "I assume you'll be going tonight, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288\t330"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "331\t408"
msgid "City's gonna be lonely without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "409\t552"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, Yuya.\\n"
"We'll come visit every now and then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "553\t613"
msgid "I look forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "673\t741"
msgid "Haruka-chan's here for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892\t952"
msgid "Guess that's my cue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "953\t1013"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172\t1267"
msgid "Hold up, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1429\t1489"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1503\t1563"
msgid "Hamazaki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1587\t1680"
msgid "I got nothing left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1744\t1818"
msgid "And it's all 'cause of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884\t1956"
msgid "My life's in tatters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1985\t2119"
msgid ""
"But I'd rather put a noose 'round my neck\\n"
"than rot behind bars."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2120\t2181"
msgid "How can you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2187\t2320"
msgid "Why not try to redeem yourself instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2341\t2401"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2407\t2558"
msgid ""
"If you're really ready to die,\\n"
"you have nothing to lose by living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2598\t2730"
msgid ""
"As long as you believe in something,\\n"
"and have the will to start fresh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2766\t2826"
msgid "I'd gladly lend you a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2872\t2987"
msgid "You expect me to believe that shit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3090\t3150"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3250\t3310"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3336\t3464"
msgid "Maybe I could buy into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4118\t4215"
msgid "You really think I got nothing to lose, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4228\t4351"
msgid ""
"Believing in stuff!?\\n"
"Starting fresh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4416\t4476"
msgid "Don't patronize me with that shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4486\t4550"
msgid "You're gonna see, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4551\t4671"
msgid ""
"Nothing matters anymore\\n"
"when you're six fucking feet under!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4683\t4761"
msgid "Don't you get it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4784\t4872"
msgid "Answer me, dipshit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4880\t5037"
msgid ""
"Once you're dead and gone, nobody's gonna\\n"
"fucking care if you believed in them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5132\t5242"
msgid "No... You're wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5350\t5457"
msgid "Hey! The hell're you doing!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5808\t5839"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5840\t5900"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5995\t6070"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6071\t6166"
msgid "Hold on, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168\t6322"
msgid "Please! Don't leave me, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6367\t6520"
msgid "You know... Mine taught me something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6562\t6654"
msgid "Even in your final moments..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6676\t6876"
msgid "You can still learn to believe in someone!"
msgstr ""